               <titlePage label="" xml:id="titlePage_f5bdc53d">
                  <p xml:id="idm56">Ved / de Massmannske Søndags= / skolers Aarsfest. / Sange af Carl Ploug / og I:P:E:Hartmann / Efter dette Udkast er Partituret / transponeret til f mol udført af G. Bohlmann. Opført første Gang ved Skolerns Aarsfest / d. 4<rend xml:id="idm57" rend="sup">de</rend> Mai 1890 i Frue Kirke.</p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_N20331">18 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_N20334">34.5 x 26</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N20337">Written in purple ink. Paper: 14 staves. Part 1 on two bifolios paginated 1-8 from the verso of the title page, last page blank. Part 2 on two bifolios paginated 1-7. Last page blank. Vocal parts notated on three staves, instrumental parts on two staves. Above the music of part 1: "No 1 Mandschor / Før Talen". Added in pencil in foreign hand: "½ Tone høiere". Above the music of part 2: "No. 2 Mandschor / efter Talen". At the end of the music of part 2 on p. 7 end-dated: "26/3 90."</physMedium>
